# RoyalRushRoomBoss2 (18120, a Four Sepulchers room boss, its shipped skills), every draw 0. Unlike its
# parent it appears with i_ai0 at 0 and no self debuff to cast. Once its AI took up the attack on the character, a hit
# by it wants its first range magic (4589) and its parent's first physical special (4572) on the character,
# each weight 1000000, beside the Warrior's hate.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic.RoyalRushRoomBoss1
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic.RoyalRushRoomBoss2
npc boss 18120 Monster 40 0 0 level 81 skill SELF_BUFF1 4318 1 skill SELF_BUFF2 4340 1 skill SELF_BUFF3 4341 1 skill PHYSICAL_SPECIAL1 4572 9 skill RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 4589 9
roll boss 99

hit boss 22
  mem boss i_ai0=0
  desires boss attack(player)=25
tick
hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=50 cast(player,4572,move)=1000000 cast(player,4589,move)=1000000
